            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.26.16+EZK.26.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 26.16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ilaiguanak le nkop ootololoitare o ninye neiborrie onyek te nebo ninye naa keyietu neishir neishiraki ninye te nedol empuruo enye e mpejoroto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe ninche te nelakua te nkuretisho o enkitamioto enye ejo, “Wooi ina anasa kitok, naa magilani Babilon. Te saa nabo eewuo endung'okinoto ino enkiguana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ilbiasharani le nkop neishir aaishiraki ninye amu meekure eetae hoo obo oitoki ainyiang'u imasaa enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Masaa e sahabu, enkosholai, o soito oogol enkinyang'a o lului, o lkarash oopuyiapui o lmorijo, o loonyokie o mpukunot pooki oo lkeek oorropil o ntokitin pooki naaguetuni too lala loo lkanchaoni, o ntokitin pooki oo nkeek naagol enkinyang'a, o suyai, o esekenkei o ltoto ooibor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olmadalasini oltankausi o enkorropil, o emanoo narropil, olbani, o enaisho oo sabibu, o eilata enkurma napuyiapui, o enkano, o nkishu o nkerrai o mbartan o ngarrin oo mbartan o rrindiki, aa taa iltauja loo ltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore ilo ng'anayioi oshi otang'uarra oltau lino nikitung'uayie iyie, ore intokitin inono pooki e nkuso o esikar kitung'uaitie ninche, nemeitokini ae kata aatum.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
