              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ilamirak le nena masaa ootudupore enkarsisisho naing'uaa ninye neitashe te nelakua te nkuretisho e mion enye, neishir neyietu abuaku ajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wooi wooi ena kito anasa naishopo apa too nkilani naapuyiapui o morijo o naanyokie, neikodi, te sahabu o too soito oogol enkinyang'a o too lului. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.23.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 23.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.26+EZK.27.27+EZK.27.28+EZK.27.29+EZK.27.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27.26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Te saa nabo eidaikieki ena arsisisho pooki.” Ore ilkituaak pooki loo melin, o ltung'ana oopuo too naaiposha, ilaisiaayiak loo melin o pooki laa ore enkinyang'a enye naa enaiposha etii neitashe te nelakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nebuaku aaishir ina kata pee edol empuruo e mpejoroto nejo, kaa anasa nanyaanyukie enkanasa kitok ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.30+EZK.27.31+EZK.27.32+EZK.27.33+EZK.27.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 27.30-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " neisuaaki enterit ilukuny enye, eishiraki ninye. Neyietu nebuaku aaishir nejo, “Wooi, wooi, te nkaraki ena anasa kitok natudupore kulo pooki ooata melin, te naiposha te ina arsisisho enye. Te saa nabo eidaikieki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 32.43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51.48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ting'idakinoyu iyie ninye na shumata o intae isinyat, o lkipaareta, o loibonok le Enkai, amu etudung' oko Enkai ninye enkiguana te nkaraki intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
